@startuml
actor User
participant "Map Screen" as UI
participant "Route Controller" as C
participant "Plan Route UseCase" as UC
participant "Route Repository" as R
participant "GeoGuide API" as API

User -> UI: set origin/destination
UI -> C: calculate
C -> UC
UC -> R
R -> API: POST /routes/plan
API --> R: route
R --> UC
UC --> C
C --> UI: route state
UI --> User: polyline + summary
@enduml
